// EFI-unofficial tutorial index (split format)
// Minecraft 1.20.1 | Forge 47.4.0
//
// This file is a quick map. The actual tutorials are split into:
//
// 1) Core / baseline behavior tutorial:
//    tutorial - core - 1.20.1 - en_us.json
//
// 2) Extension features tutorial:
//    tutorial - extensions - 1.20.1 - en_us.json
//
// Why split?
// - Core file explains the original/base behavior surface and base predicates.
// - Extensions file explains what EFI adds on top (NBT tag path, TACZ helpers,
//   ammo routing, gear swap, and extension predicates/behaviors).
//
// Notes:
// - TACZ is an optional extension, not the centerpiece.
// - nbt_tag is also an extension path, alternative to registry-path-keyed files.
// - Base Epic Fight datapack logic remains valid and supported.
